// Command app 是 {{ .Name }} 的可执行入口：装配框架门面、注册路由并优雅退出。 | Command app is the executable entry point of {{ .Name }}: it assembles the framework facade, registers the routes and exits gracefully.
//
// 装配顺序：日志 → 退出信号 → 资产/配置门面 → 中间件 → 静态挂载 → 路由。
// Assembly order: logger → shutdown signal → assets/configuration facade → middleware → static mount → routes.
//
// 这里使用 app.New 而不是 app.Default：Default 固定使用框架内嵌资产，既不接受 app.WithFS，
// 也无法把本项目的 web/templates 与 web/static 交给渲染器与 /static 处理器。
// This entry point uses app.New rather than app.Default: Default pins the framework's embedded assets, accepts no
// app.WithFS and therefore cannot feed this project's web/templates and web/static to the renderer or the /static
// handler. assemble 复刻了 Default 的全部约定（同一组中间件、同一个 /static 前缀、同一份 i18n 装配），
// 只把资产源换成本项目的 web 包。
// assemble replicates every Default convention (the same middleware chain, the same /static prefix, the same i18n
// wiring) and swaps only the asset source for this project's web package.
// 若某个项目不需要自带资产，入口可以退回一行 a, err := app.Default()。
// A project that needs no assets of its own can fall back to the single line a, err := app.Default().
package main

import (
	"context"
	"os"
	"os/signal"
{{- if .I18n }}
	"strings"
{{- end }}
	"syscall"

	"{{ .Module }}/internal/meta"
	"{{ .Module }}/internal/middleware"
	"{{ .Module }}/internal/router"
	"{{ .Module }}/web"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/app"
	"{{ .YdModule }}/errx"
{{- if .I18n }}
	"{{ .YdModule }}/i18n"
{{- end }}
	"{{ .YdModule }}/logx"
	ydmw "{{ .YdModule }}/middleware"
)

// 启动期哨兵错误：装配链上任一步失败都以它们为根因，日志与退出码据此统一处理。
// Startup sentinels: any failing step of the assembly chain roots in one of them, so logs and the exit code stay uniform.
var (
	// ErrAssemble 表示应用门面装配失败（资产、配置或渲染器任一步出错）。 | ErrAssemble reports a facade assembly failure (assets, configuration or renderer).
	ErrAssemble = errx.New("application assembly failed | 应用装配失败")
	// ErrStatic 表示静态资产文件系统不可用。 | ErrStatic reports an unusable static asset filesystem.
	ErrStatic = errx.New("static assets unavailable | 静态资产不可用")
{{- if .I18n }}
	// ErrI18n 表示语言目录加载失败。 | ErrI18n reports a failed message catalogue load.
	ErrI18n = errx.New("message catalogues unavailable | 语言目录不可用")
{{- end }}
)

// main 是进程入口：构造日志与退出上下文，装配成功后阻塞运行，直到收到退出信号。
// main is the process entry point: it builds the logger and the shutdown context, then blocks in Run until a signal arrives.
func main() {
	// 日志先于一切装配：任何一步失败都必须留下可检索的记录，且日志器本身不会失败。
	// The logger comes first: a failure anywhere downstream must leave a searchable record, and the logger itself cannot fail.
	log := logx.New(logx.Options{Service: meta.Name, Caller: true})
	logx.SetDefault(log)

	// 退出信号经 context 传递：SIGINT/SIGTERM 触发优雅退出，在途请求被等待收尾。
	// Shutdown signals travel through the context: SIGINT/SIGTERM triggers a graceful exit that drains in-flight requests.
	ctx, stop := signal.NotifyContext(context.Background(), os.Interrupt, syscall.SIGTERM)
	defer stop()

	application, err := assemble(log)
	if err != nil {
		log.Error("application assembly failed | 应用装配失败", logx.Err(err))
		os.Exit(1)
	}

	log.Info("application assembled | 应用已装配",
		logx.Str("name", meta.Name),
		logx.Str("module", meta.Module),
		logx.Str("version", meta.Version),
		logx.Str("env", meta.Env()),
		logx.Strs("features", meta.Features),
	)

	if err := application.Run(ctx); err != nil {
		log.Error("application stopped with an error | 应用异常退出", logx.Err(err))
		os.Exit(1)
	}
	log.Info("application stopped | 应用已停止")
}

// assemble 装配应用门面：资产 → 配置 → 中间件 → 静态挂载 → i18n → 路由。
// assemble wires the facade: assets → configuration → middleware → static mount → i18n → routes.
//
// 返回的错误一律可 errors.Is 判定到包级哨兵，调用方无须解析文案。
// Every returned error satisfies errors.Is against a package-level sentinel, so callers never parse messages.
func assemble(log *logx.Logger) (*app.App, error) {
	static, err := web.Static()
	if err != nil {
		return nil, errx.WrapDetail(err, ErrStatic, "root=%s", meta.AssetRoot)
	}

	application, err := app.New(
		app.WithFS(web.Assets()),
		app.WithLogger(log),
		app.WithConfigDir(meta.ConfigDir),
	)
	if err != nil {
		return nil, errx.Wrap(err, ErrAssemble)
	}

	// 中间件顺序与 app.Default 保持一致（恢复 → 请求 ID → 访问日志 → 压缩 → CORS），
	// 其后追加本项目的补充中间件：顺序即执行顺序，安全头必须在最外层之外尽早生效。
	// The middleware order matches app.Default (recover → request id → access log → compress → CORS) with this
	// project's extras appended: the order is the execution order, and security headers should land as early as possible.
	application.Use(
		ydmw.Recover(log),
		ydmw.RequestID(""),
		ydmw.AccessLog(log),
		ydmw.Compress(ydmw.CompressOptions{}),
		ydmw.CORS(ydmw.CORSOptions{}),
		middleware.Security(),
	)

	// 静态资源前缀与框架默认值一致；web.Static 已合并框架 vendor 脚本与本项目样式。
	// The static prefix matches the framework default; web.Static has already merged the framework's vendored scripts with this project's styles.
	application.Router().StaticFS("/static", static)
{{- if .I18n }}

	if err := registerI18n(application, log); err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
{{- end }}

	if err := router.Register(application); err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
	return application, nil
}
{{- if .I18n }}

// registerI18n 从资产树加载语言目录并挂上语言解析中间件。 | registerI18n loads the catalogues from the asset tree and mounts the locale middleware.
//
// 与 app.Default 的差别仅有目录来源：这里读取本项目的 web/langs，而不是框架内嵌文案。
// The only difference from app.Default is the catalogue source: this reads the project's web/langs instead of the framework's embedded messages.
// 默认语言优先取配置项 i18n.default_lang，缺失时回退到 internal/meta 的常量，保证两条路径给出同一个值。
// The default language prefers the i18n.default_lang configuration key and falls back to the internal/meta constant, so both paths agree.
func registerI18n(application *app.App, log *logx.Logger) error {
	defaultLang := strings.TrimSpace(application.Config().GetString("i18n.default_lang"))
	if defaultLang == "" {
		defaultLang = meta.DefaultLang
	}

	bundle, err := i18n.New(web.Langs(), ".", defaultLang)
	if err != nil {
		return errx.WrapDetail(err, ErrI18n, "default_lang=%s", defaultLang)
	}

	application.Set(app.ServiceI18n, bundle)
	application.Use(i18n.Middleware(bundle, i18n.Options{}))
	log.Info("i18n catalogues loaded | 语言目录已加载",
		logx.Str("default", bundle.DefaultLang()),
		logx.Strs("langs", bundle.Langs()),
	)
	return nil
}
{{- end }}
